  description: 'Cannot be Special Summoned. Once per turn, during the End Phase,
    if this card was Normal Summoned or flipped face-up this turn: Return this card
    to the hand. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ichiki Sayori-Hime"
    once per turn. If you control a monster with 800 ATK or DEF, and this card is
    in your hand: Immediately after this effect resolves, you can Normal Summon this
    card. If this card is Normal Summoned: You can add 1 Level 4 LIGHT or DARK monster
    with 800 ATK or DEF from your Deck to your hand, except "Ichiki Sayori-Hime".'
